      "assessment": "Each vessel contains sealed dry air plus5 mmol extra gas. Full owned inventory and independent integralCv reproduce each1 J increment; helium arm warms more than nitrogen. Pressure reconstructs from totalnRT/V. No evacuated headspace or naive pure-gas temperature ratio assumed.",
      "result": "candidate_met_pending_parent_review"
    },
